{# Who We Are #}
<section class="bg-zinc-950 py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-5">Who We Are – FAS Expedition</h2>

    <p class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-10 leading-snug">Adventure begins where standard solutions end.</p>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-16">
      <p>An expedition vehicle is far more than just a vehicle. It is the foundation for adventure, independence, and the confidence to safely reach even the most remote places on earth. That is exactly why we at FAS Expedition develop and build premium expedition vehicles that are uncompromisingly designed for use under extreme conditions. We combine engineering expertise, high-quality craftsmanship, and a passion for travel into a comprehensive concept that goes far beyond conventional vehicle construction.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">Our Vision</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">We enable boundless freedom off the beaten path. With our premium expedition vehicles, we create the foundation for unforgettable adventures – regardless of terrain, climate, or distance. Our team combines enthusiasm for camping, technology, and long-distance travel with years of experience in vehicle construction. This passion can be found in every detail of our vehicles.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">Our Mission</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">We develop and build individual expedition vehicles at the highest level of quality. We combine engineering excellence, a passion for travel, and uncompromising functionality. Every vehicle is fully designed and technically planned before production begins – because quality does not happen by chance, but through consistent planning.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">More Than Vehicle Construction</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">We do not simply build expedition vehicles – we develop well-thought-out complete systems. Furniture construction, power supply, water technology, heating, climate control, and vehicle technology are perfectly coordinated from the very beginning. Equally important to us is exceptionally comprehensive documentation. It creates transparency, simplifies maintenance and repairs, and helps our customers understand and use their vehicle optimally anywhere in the world.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">Quality Down to the Smallest Detail</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">For us, premium means far more than high-quality materials. Quality is visible in precise furniture construction, carefully selected surfaces, and workmanship designed for longevity. Equally important, however, are the invisible details: well-engineered electrical systems, high-performance battery storage, modern water treatment, intelligent heating and climate concepts, and a technical infrastructure you can rely on anywhere in the world. Our customers entrust us with their adventure. We meet this trust with the utmost care and an uncompromising commitment to quality.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-6">Our Values</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">Our company culture is based on convictions that guide our daily work.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-white font-bold shrink-0">—</span><span><strong class="text-white">Freedom &amp; Adventure</strong> – We share the passion for discovering new paths.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-white font-bold shrink-0">—</span><span><strong class="text-white">Quality &amp; Precision</strong> – Every detail is carefully considered and designed for longevity.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-white font-bold shrink-0">—</span><span><strong class="text-white">Innovation &amp; Initiative</strong> – Our young team develops ideas and takes responsibility.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-white font-bold shrink-0">—</span><span><strong class="text-white">Openness &amp; Trust</strong> – Flat hierarchies, honest communication, and mutual respect create an environment where good solutions emerge.</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="text-white font-bold shrink-0">—</span><span><strong class="text-white">Flexibility &amp; Self-Determination</strong> – Self-directed work and flexible working models are a matter of course for us.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">People Make the Difference</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Behind every expedition vehicle stands a team that carries out its work with passion. We believe that the best results come when people enjoy what they do. That is why we create a modern working environment with individual benefits and a company culture in which commitment is seen and valued.</p>
          <p>Our employees continuously develop their skills and actively contribute their ideas to our products. This combination of expertise, creativity, and enthusiasm is exactly what makes every FAS vehicle unique.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">Why a Wolf Graces Our Logo</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>Many customers ask us about the meaning behind our logo.</p>
          <p>The wolf has always stood for vastness, endurance, resilience, and independence – qualities that also characterise our expedition vehicles. They enable self-sufficient travel over long distances, with high range and confident off-road capability to safely reach even the most remote regions of the world.</p>
          <p>At the same time, the wolf holds a very personal meaning for us: our company is located directly on the High Fens (Hautes Fagnes), a cross-border nature reserve and well-known wolf protection area in the German-Belgian border region. Our connection to this unique landscape and its symbolic animal was therefore a natural inspiration for our company logo.</p>
          <p>The wolf thus stands not only for adventure, but also for our home.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">Built for People Who Think Further</h3>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          <p>With the highest engineering excellence, precise craftsmanship, and genuine passion, we develop expedition vehicles that function reliably worldwide and enable their owners to experience exactly what travel is truly about:</p>
          <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Boundless freedom.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# Team #}
<section class="bg-zinc-950 py-24 lg:py-32 border-t border-zinc-800">
  <div class="max-w-[1800px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-4">Meet Our Team</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-400 text-lg">Hardly a team member who isn't infected by the camping and travel bug.</p>
    </div>
    {% set teamContent = pageContent.team %}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-4 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      {% for section in teamContent.sections %}
        {% for person in section.people %}
          <div class="team-card group cursor-pointer border border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-600 transition-colors bg-zinc-900" onclick="toggleTeamCard(this)">
            <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
              {% if person.image %}
                <img src="{{ person.image }}" alt="{{ person.name }}" class="w-full aspect-square object-cover object-top" loading="lazy">
              {% else %}
                <div class="w-full aspect-square bg-zinc-800 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <span class="text-zinc-600 text-4xl font-bold">{{ person.name[0] }}</span>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
              {% if person.description %}
                <div class="team-card-indicator absolute bottom-2 right-2 w-7 h-7 bg-black/70 flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="p-4">
              <p class="text-white font-bold text-sm tracking-wider leading-tight">{{ person.name }}</p>
              {% if person.roles and person.roles.length > 0 %}
                <p class="text-zinc-500 text-xs mt-1 leading-tight">{{ person.roles[0] }}</p>
              {% endif %}
              {% if person.description %}
                <div class="team-card-desc overflow-hidden max-h-0 transition-[max-height] duration-500 ease-in-out">
                  <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-700">{{ person.description }}</p>
                </div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  function toggleTeamCard(card) {
    const desc = card.querySelector('.team-card-desc');
    const indicator = card.querySelector('.team-card-indicator svg');
    if (!desc) return;
    const isOpen = desc.style.maxHeight && desc.style.maxHeight !== '0px';
    if (isOpen) {
      desc.style.maxHeight = '0px';
      card.querySelector('.team-card-indicator').classList.remove('bg-white/20');
      if (indicator) indicator.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)';
    } else {
      desc.style.maxHeight = desc.scrollHeight + 'px';
      card.querySelector('.team-card-indicator').classList.add('bg-white/20');
      if (indicator) indicator.style.transform = 'rotate(45deg)';
    }
  }
</script>

