      </div>
      <div class="p-8 border border-zinc-800">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-white mb-4">Services</h3>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Vehicle inspection &amp; maintenance, recovery equipment consulting, modification requests — for all expedition vehicle owners.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

